47	 * success scenario, behind every alternative flow, and behind every business
48	 * rule. Specifications with any other status are exempt: this project writes
49	 * the specification first, so an unimplemented use case is a normal
50	 * intermediate state, not a violation. The status line is what turns the
51	 * coverage requirement on, which is precisely why it must not be set by hand
52	 * without evidence.
